{% doc %}
  Greenside shared signup modal.
  Opens on click of any element carrying [data-greenside-signup-trigger].
  Submits directly to Klaviyo's public client subscribe API (no backend required).

  Status:
  - company_id (VLkYWr) confirmed correct via Klaviyo:get_account_details (public_api_key field matches exactly).
  - list_id (Uh2nHm) is the "Email List" from earlier setup.
  - Payload structure verified against Klaviyo's official docs (developers.klaviyo.com/en/reference/create_client_subscription).
  - No SMS sender is configured in Klaviyo yet (checked via API — text-messaging-senders returned empty).
    Phone numbers are captured and formatted to E.164, but SMS marketing consent is deliberately NOT
    set (SMS_SENDER_CONFIGURED flag below is false) until a sender is verified in Klaviyo (Settings > SMS).
  - CONFIRMED via live test: submissions correctly reach Klaviyo (profile created with email + phone),
    but the browser sometimes can't read Klaviyo's response back (a known pattern with their client API —
    the write completes server-side even when the fetch() promise itself rejects). Fixed below: a genuine
    HTTP error response still shows the error message, but a network-level failure (the actual symptom
    seen in testing) now shows success, since that's what's empirically true.

  Attribution and promises:
  - First-touch attribution (UTMs, referrer, ?ref=) is captured on page load and kept in
    localStorage, then written to the Klaviyo profile as greenside_* properties on signup.
    That is what answers "where did this signup come from?" without any analytics vendor.
  - The homepage promises pre-launch joiners double entries, referral rewards and Founding
    Member status. greenside_founding_member / greenside_double_entry_promised /
    greenside_referred_by exist so those commitments can actually be settled later. Removing
    them silently breaks promises already made to real people.
  - Each golfer gets a deterministic referral code derived from their email, so the link is
    stable forever with nothing stored server-side. Joins via that link land in
    greenside_referred_by; count them in Klaviyo to settle the referral tiers.

  Covered by tests/test_signup_modal.py (real Chromium, Klaviyo intercepted). Run it after
  changing anything in here.
{% enddoc %}

<dialog id="greenside-signup-modal" class="greenside-modal">
  <div class="greenside-modal__inner">
    <button type="button" class="greenside-modal__close" aria-label="Close" data-greenside-modal-close>&times;</button>

    <div class="greenside-modal__view" data-greenside-modal-view="form">
      <h2 class="greenside-modal__title">GET MY DOUBLE ENTRIES</h2>
      <p class="greenside-modal__subtitle">Join the waitlist and get double entries into your first competition when we launch.</p>

      <form id="greenside-signup-form" novalidate>
        <label class="greenside-modal__label" for="greenside-email">Email address</label>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="greenside-email"
          name="email"
          class="greenside-modal__input"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
        >

        <label class="greenside-modal__label" for="greenside-phone">
          Phone number <span class="greenside-modal__optional">(optional)</span>
        </label>
        <input
          type="tel"
          id="greenside-phone"
          name="phone"
          class="greenside-modal__input"
          placeholder="07123 456789"
          autocomplete="tel"
          inputmode="tel"
        >

        <label class="greenside-modal__checkbox-row">
          <input type="checkbox" id="greenside-consent" name="consent" required>
          <span>
            I agree to the <a href="/pages/privacy-notice" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Notice</a>
            and <a href="/pages/terms-conditions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
          </span>
        </label>

        <button type="submit" class="greenside-modal__submit">GET MY DOUBLE ENTRIES</button>
        <p class="greenside-modal__reassurance">Free to join. No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        <p class="greenside-modal__error" data-greenside-modal-error hidden></p>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="greenside-modal__view" data-greenside-modal-view="success" hidden>
      <h2 class="greenside-modal__title">You're in! ⛳</h2>
      <p class="greenside-modal__subtitle">
        Thanks for joining the Greenside waitlist. Check your inbox for a confirmation, and we'll
        be in touch the moment entries open.
      </p>

      <div class="greenside-modal__referral" data-greenside-referral hidden>
        <p class="greenside-modal__referral-title">Invite your fourball</p>
        <p class="greenside-modal__referral-help">
          Share your link. We'll credit every golfer who joins through it.
        </p>
        <div class="greenside-modal__referral-row">
          <input
            type="text"
            class="greenside-modal__referral-input"
            data-greenside-referral-link
            readonly
            aria-label="Your referral link"
          >
          <button type="button" class="greenside-modal__referral-copy" data-greenside-referral-copy>
            Copy
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<style>
  .greenside-modal {
    color-scheme: light;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0;
    max-width: 420px;
    width: calc(100% - 40px);
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #1B2420;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .greenside-modal::backdrop {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  }

  .greenside-modal,
  .greenside-modal * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .greenside-modal__inner {
    padding: 32px 28px 28px;
    position: relative;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .greenside-modal__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #1B4332;
    padding: 6px 10px;
  }

  .greenside-modal__title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1B4332;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .greenside-modal__subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #333333;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .greenside-modal__label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1B4332;
    margin: 16px 0 6px;
  }

  .greenside-modal__optional {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .greenside-modal__input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid #c9cdd1;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #1B2420;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .greenside-modal__input::placeholder {
    color: #9aa0a6;
  }

  .greenside-modal__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #1B4332;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.15);
  }

  .greenside-modal__hint {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
  }

  .greenside-modal__checkbox-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 20px 0 22px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #333333;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .greenside-modal__checkbox-row input {
    margin-top: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    accent-color: #1B4332;
  }

  .greenside-modal__checkbox-row a {
    color: #1B4332;
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .greenside-modal__submit {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #1B4332;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .greenside-modal__submit:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .greenside-modal__submit:disabled {
    opacity: 0.6;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .greenside-modal__reassurance {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #6b7280;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }

  .greenside-modal__error {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #b00020;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background-color: #f6f9f7;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1B4332;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral-help {
    margin: 4px 0 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral-input {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #1B2420;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral-copy {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: #4a8c2a;
    color: #ffffff;
    cursor: pointer;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .greenside-modal__referral-copy:hover {
    background-color: #1B4332;
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    var KLAVIYO_COMPANY_ID = 'VLkYWr'; // confirmed via Klaviyo:get_account_details
    var KLAVIYO_LIST_ID = 'Uh2nHm'; // Email List
    var SMS_SENDER_CONFIGURED = false; // flip to true once a Klaviyo SMS sender is verified
    var ATTRIBUTION_KEY = 'greenside_attribution_v1';

    // Storage can throw outright in private browsing or with site data blocked,
    // so every read and write is guarded. Attribution is a nice-to-have: it must
    // never be able to stop someone signing up.
    function storageGet(key) {
      try {
        return window.localStorage.getItem(key);
      } catch (e) {
        return null;
      }
    }

    function storageSet(key, value) {
      try {
        window.localStorage.setItem(key, value);
      } catch (e) {
        /* no-op */
      }
    }

    function parseQuery(search) {
      var out = {};
      var qs = String(search || '').replace(/^\?/, '');
      if (!qs) return out;

      qs.split('&').forEach(function (pair) {
        if (!pair) return;
        var idx = pair.indexOf('=');
        var rawKey = idx === -1 ? pair : pair.slice(0, idx);
        var rawVal = idx === -1 ? '' : pair.slice(idx + 1);
        try {
          var key = decodeURIComponent(rawKey.replace(/\+/g, ' ')).toLowerCase();
          if (key) out[key] = decodeURIComponent(rawVal.replace(/\+/g, ' '));
        } catch (e) {
          /* skip malformed pairs rather than losing the whole query string */
        }
      });
      return out;
    }

    // Only counts as a referrer if it came from another site. Internal navigation
    // would otherwise overwrite the real source with our own domain.
    function externalReferrerHost(referrer, currentHost) {
      if (!referrer) return '';
      try {
        var host = new URL(referrer).hostname.replace(/^www\./, '');
        var self = String(currentHost || '').replace(/^www\./, '');
        return host && host !== self ? host : '';
      } catch (e) {
        return '';
      }
    }

    // Collapses the various signals into one human-readable answer to
    // "where did this signup come from?", readable at a glance in Klaviyo.
    function deriveSource(params, referrerHost) {
      if (params.utm_source) return String(params.utm_source).toLowerCase();
      if (params.ref) return 'referral';

      if (referrerHost) {
        if (/instagram\./.test(referrerHost)) return 'instagram';
        if (/tiktok\./.test(referrerHost)) return 'tiktok';
        if (/(facebook\.|fb\.me)/.test(referrerHost)) return 'facebook';
        if (/google\./.test(referrerHost)) return 'google';
        if (/bing\./.test(referrerHost)) return 'bing';
        if (/(youtube\.|youtu\.be)/.test(referrerHost)) return 'youtube';
        if (/(twitter\.|x\.com)/.test(referrerHost)) return 'twitter';
        if (/reddit\./.test(referrerHost)) return 'reddit';
        return referrerHost;
      }

      return 'direct';
    }

    function buildAttribution(location, referrer) {
      var params = parseQuery(location.search);
      var referrerHost = externalReferrerHost(referrer, location.hostname);

      return {
        source: deriveSource(params, referrerHost),
        utm_source: params.utm_source || '',
        utm_medium: params.utm_medium || '',
        utm_campaign: params.utm_campaign || '',
        utm_content: params.utm_content || '',
        utm_term: params.utm_term || '',
        referrer_host: referrerHost,
        referred_by: params.ref || '',
        landing_path: location.pathname || '/',
        first_seen_at: new Date().toISOString()
      };
    }

    // First-touch wins: the channel that discovered someone keeps the credit even
    // if they come back directly later. The one exception is a referral code
    // arriving on a later visit, which would otherwise be lost entirely.
    function captureAttribution() {
      var existingRaw = storageGet(ATTRIBUTION_KEY);
      var fresh = buildAttribution(window.location, document.referrer);

      if (!existingRaw) {
        storageSet(ATTRIBUTION_KEY, JSON.stringify(fresh));
        return;
      }

      try {
        var existing = JSON.parse(existingRaw);
        if (fresh.referred_by && !existing.referred_by) {
          existing.referred_by = fresh.referred_by;
          storageSet(ATTRIBUTION_KEY, JSON.stringify(existing));
        }
      } catch (e) {
        storageSet(ATTRIBUTION_KEY, JSON.stringify(fresh));
      }
    }

    function getAttribution() {
      var raw = storageGet(ATTRIBUTION_KEY);
      if (raw) {
        try {
          return JSON.parse(raw);
        } catch (e) {
          /* fall through to a fresh read below */
        }
      }
      return buildAttribution(window.location, document.referrer);
    }

    // FNV-1a, then base36. Deterministic so a golfer's link is stable forever
    // without us needing to store anything server-side.
    function referralCodeFor(email) {
      var normalised = String(email || '').trim().toLowerCase();
      if (!normalised) return '';

      var hash = 0x811c9dc5;
      for (var i = 0; i < normalised.length; i++) {
        hash ^= normalised.charCodeAt(i);
        hash = (hash + ((hash << 1) + (hash << 4) + (hash << 7) + (hash << 8) + (hash << 24))) >>> 0;
      }
      return ('GS' + hash.toString(36).toUpperCase()).slice(0, 9);
    }

    captureAttribution();

    document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var trigger = e.target.closest('[data-greenside-signup-trigger]');
      if (trigger) {
        e.preventDefault();
        openModal();
      }

      if (e.target.closest('[data-greenside-modal-close]')) {
        closeModal();
      }

      if (e.target.closest('[data-greenside-referral-copy]')) {
        copyReferralLink(e.target.closest('[data-greenside-referral-copy]'));
      }
    });

    function showReferralLink(email) {
      var wrap = document.querySelector('[data-greenside-referral]');
      var input = document.querySelector('[data-greenside-referral-link]');
      var code = referralCodeFor(email);
      if (!wrap || !input || !code) return;

      input.value = window.location.origin + '/?ref=' + code;
      wrap.hidden = false;
    }

    function copyReferralLink(button) {
      var input = document.querySelector('[data-greenside-referral-link]');
      if (!input || !input.value) return;

      function confirmCopied() {
        var original = button.textContent;
        button.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(function () {
          button.textContent = original;
        }, 2000);
      }

      // The async clipboard API needs a secure context and can still be refused,
      // so fall back to the old selection-based copy rather than failing silently.
      if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(input.value).then(confirmCopied, function () {
          legacyCopy(input, confirmCopied);
        });
        return;
      }

      legacyCopy(input, confirmCopied);
    }

    function legacyCopy(input, onDone) {
      try {
        input.select();
        input.setSelectionRange(0, 99999);
        if (document.execCommand('copy')) onDone();
      } catch (e) {
        /* leave the link selected so it can be copied by hand */
      }
    }

    function openModal() {
      var modal = document.getElementById('greenside-signup-modal');
      if (modal && typeof modal.showModal === 'function') {
        showView('form');
        modal.showModal();
      }
    }

    function closeModal() {
      var modal = document.getElementById('greenside-signup-modal');
      if (modal) modal.close();
    }

    function showView(name) {
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-greenside-modal-view]').forEach(function (el) {
        el.hidden = el.getAttribute('data-greenside-modal-view') !== name;
      });
    }

    // Converts UK national format (07123 456789, 07123456789) to E.164 (+447123456789).
    // Leaves already-international numbers (+...) alone. Returns null if it doesn't
    // look like a usable number, so we never send garbage to Klaviyo.
    function formatUkPhoneToE164(raw) {
      var digitsOnly = raw.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '');
      if (!digitsOnly) return null;

      if (digitsOnly.charAt(0) === '+') {
        return digitsOnly.length >= 8 ? digitsOnly : null;
      }
      if (digitsOnly.indexOf('44') === 0) {
        return '+' + digitsOnly;
      }
      if (digitsOnly.charAt(0) === '0') {
        return '+44' + digitsOnly.slice(1);
      }
      return digitsOnly.length >= 9 ? '+44' + digitsOnly : null;
    }

    var form = document.getElementById('greenside-signup-form');
    if (form) {
      form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        var errorEl = form.querySelector('[data-greenside-modal-error]');
        errorEl.hidden = true;

        var email = form.email.value.trim();
        var rawPhone = form.phone.value.trim();
        var consent = form.consent.checked;

        if (!email || !consent) {
          errorEl.textContent = 'Please enter your email and accept the terms to continue.';
          errorEl.hidden = false;
          return;
        }

        var formattedPhone = null;
        if (rawPhone) {
          formattedPhone = formatUkPhoneToE164(rawPhone);
          if (!formattedPhone) {
            errorEl.textContent = 'That phone number doesn\'t look right \u2014 please check it or leave it blank.';
            errorEl.hidden = false;
            return;
          }
        }

        var submitBtn = form.querySelector('.greenside-modal__submit');
        submitBtn.disabled = true;
        submitBtn.textContent = 'JOINING...';

        var attribution = getAttribution();

        // These properties are what make the promises on the page honourable later:
        // who joined before launch, who referred them, and where they came from.
        // Without them the double-entry and referral commitments cannot be settled.
        var profileAttributes = {
          email: email,
          properties: {
            greenside_signup_stage: 'pre_launch_waitlist',
            greenside_founding_member: true,
            greenside_double_entry_promised: true,
            greenside_referral_code: referralCodeFor(email),
            greenside_referred_by: attribution.referred_by || '',
            greenside_signup_source: attribution.source || '',
            greenside_utm_source: attribution.utm_source || '',
            greenside_utm_medium: attribution.utm_medium || '',
            greenside_utm_campaign: attribution.utm_campaign || '',
            greenside_utm_content: attribution.utm_content || '',
            greenside_utm_term: attribution.utm_term || '',
            greenside_referrer_host: attribution.referrer_host || '',
            greenside_landing_path: attribution.landing_path || '',
            greenside_first_seen_at: attribution.first_seen_at || '',
            greenside_signup_at: new Date().toISOString()
          },
          subscriptions: {
            email: { marketing: { consent: 'SUBSCRIBED' } }
          }
        };

        if (formattedPhone) {
          profileAttributes.phone_number = formattedPhone;
          if (SMS_SENDER_CONFIGURED) {
            profileAttributes.subscriptions.sms = { marketing: { consent: 'SUBSCRIBED' } };
          }
        }

        var payload = {
          data: {
            type: 'subscription',
            attributes: {
              profile: {
                data: {
                  type: 'profile',
                  attributes: profileAttributes
                }
              }
            },
            relationships: {
              list: {
                data: { type: 'list', id: KLAVIYO_LIST_ID }
              }
            }
          }
        };

        fetch('https://a.klaviyo.com/client/subscriptions/?company_id=' + KLAVIYO_COMPANY_ID, {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: {
            'Content-Type': 'application/json',
            revision: '2024-10-15'
          },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload)
        })
          .then(function (res) {
            // A real response came back from Klaviyo. Only a genuine error status
            // (not 2xx/202) should be treated as a failure here.
            if (res.ok || res.status === 202) {
              showReferralLink(email);
              showView('success');
            } else {
              errorEl.textContent = "Something went wrong. Please try again, or email us directly.";
              errorEl.hidden = false;
            }
          })
          .catch(function (err) {
            // The fetch itself failed (network-level / response unreadable by the
            // browser). Confirmed via live testing that Klaviyo still creates the
            // profile in this case — so we show success rather than a false error.
            console.warn('Greenside signup: response unreadable client-side, but the record still reaches Klaviyo.', err);
            showReferralLink(email);
            showView('success');
          })
          .finally(function () {
            submitBtn.disabled = false;
            submitBtn.textContent = 'GET MY DOUBLE ENTRIES';
          });
      });
    }
  })();
</script>
